---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
import { Clock, Users, FileX } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<Section id="problem" className="relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Elements -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full max-w-5xl aspect-square bg-linear-to-tr from-tomato via-transparent to-espresso opacity-[0.03] blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-muted/50 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground backdrop-blur-sm border border-border/50 mb-8">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
      La realidad del sector
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-balance leading-tight mb-16">
      "La hostelería no es difícil por la comida. <br class="hidden md:block" /> Es difícil por la <span class="italic text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-br from-foreground to-muted-foreground">gestión caótica</span>."
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
      <!-- Pain Point 1 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card/30 border border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-tomato/5 hover:border-tomato/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-tomato/10 flex items-center justify-center text-tomato mb-4 ring-1 ring-tomato/20 group-hover:bg-tomato/20 transition-colors">
            <Clock class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Tiempos muertos</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Camareros corriendo entre la sala y el TPV. Cocina descifrando tickets en papel.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pain Point 2 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card/30 border border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blueberry/5 hover:border-blueberry/20 transition-all duration-300">
         <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blueberry/10 flex items-center justify-center text-blueberry mb-4 ring-1 ring-blueberry/20 group-hover:bg-blueberry/20 transition-colors">
            <Users class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Errores de personal</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          "¿Quién pidió esto?" Platos fríos esperando ser servidos. Propinas perdidas.
        </p>
      </div>

       <!-- Pain Point 3 -->
      <div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card/30 border border-border/50 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-espresso/5 hover:border-espresso/20 transition-all duration-300">
         <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-espresso/10 flex items-center justify-center text-espresso mb-4 ring-1 ring-espresso/20 group-hover:bg-espresso/20 transition-colors">
            <FileX class="h-7 w-7" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium mb-2">Descontrol total</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Cierre de caja con descuadres. Sin datos reales de qué se vende y qué no.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute -z-10 top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-144.5 aspect-1155/678 bg-linear-to-tr from-tomato to-espresso opacity-10 blur-3xl rotate-30 sm:w-288.75"></div>
</Section>
